  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/521c6085-9024-4f85-b6df-25d8e41a70d7-image.png\" style=\"width: 330px; height: 168px;\" /></p><p>&nbsp;As&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>&#8741;</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>Slope</mi><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>Slope</mi><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></msub></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;slope of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>B</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>D</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p>",
